/Alt (Four panel line graph shows training diagnostics over 50 epochs. Panel one, Total Loss \(Gaussian NLL\), shows Training Loss decreasing sharply from 1.40 to 1.14, then gradually to 1.13 at epoch 50. Validation Loss similarly decreases from 1.37 to 1.13. Early Stop: Epoch 50 is marked. Panel two, Proxy Detection Accuracy, shows Training Proxy-Acc starting at 0.98, rising to 0.99, fluctuating 0.98-0.99, ending at 0.99. Validation Proxy-Acc starts at 0.98, rises to 0.985, then fluctuates around 0.98. Panel three, Proxy Detection F1, shows Training Proxy-F1 starting at 0.98, rising to 0.99, fluctuating 0.98-0.99, ending at 0.99. Validation Proxy-F1 starts at 0.98, rises to 0.985, then fluctuates around 0.98. Panel four, Proxy Detection Precision, shows Training Proxy-Pr starting at 0.96, rising to 0.98, fluctuating 0.97-0.98, ending at 0.985. Validation Proxy-Pr starts at 0.97, fluctuates 0.96-0.97, and ends at 0.965. All vertical axes range from 0.95 to 1.00 for accuracy, F1, and precision, and 1.15 to 1.40 for loss. All horizontal axes range from 0 to 50 epochs.)
